	"Description": "Simply allows you to feed kelples using the feeding basket. :)\n<br />\n<br />In order to keep it similar to Core Keeper, since kelp is not an item, I stuck to allowing seaweed and algae as it's primary food source.\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />Allows keples to be fed the following items:\n<br />\n<br />[list=1]\n<br />[*]Seaweed\n<br />[*]Green Algae\n<br />[*]White Algae\n<br />[/list]\n<br />Additional compatibility with Stardew Valley Expanded, allowing 2 more items to be fed to kelples:[list=1]\n<br />[*]Dulse Seaweed\n<br />[*]Seaweed Salad\n<br />[/list]",
